menuconfig DRIVERS_SLCAN
	bool "slcan"
	default n
	depends on PLATFORM_NUTTX
	depends on DRIVERS_UAVCAN || DRIVERS_UAVCANNODE
	---help---
		LAWICEL SLCAN bridge from a NuttX SocketCAN iface (can0/can1)
		to a serial/USB port. Used by DroneCAN GUI Tool.

		Requires NuttX CONFIG_NET_CAN. Does not take the CAN controller
		from UAVCAN: it opens a second PF_CAN socket. Does not change
		the bus bitrate (UAVCAN_BITRATE / CANNODE_BITRATE remains the
		source of truth). Disabled while armed.
